1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,210
I'm stepping down as the lead.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,210
What? Why?

3
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:09,220
I just can't do it.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,510
No, you can't!

5
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:13,720
I'm the one who chose you for this role.

6
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:16,140
I can't work with you
when you're like this!

7
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,890
I'm sorry for sounding
so presumptuous.

8
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:21,350
I have no right
to say things like that.

9
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,110
Especially after getting hurt
and causing everyone so much trouble.

10
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,320
Haru-senpai...

11
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:33,620
You came to my house
that night, didn't you?

12
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:36,410
The only person who would pick this up
and bring it back to me...

13
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,410
would be you.

14
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:40,920
That's...

15
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,420
You cherish the things

16
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:45,250
that are precious to me.

17
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:49,010
If you know that, then don't talk
about stepping down.

18
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:50,510
That's exactly why!

19
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:53,090
You're always so honest and strong
when it comes to theater.

20
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,720
I love that about you!

21
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:58,060
But seeing you panic over my injury...

22
00:00:58,060 --> 00:01:00,100
That's not the senpai I know!

23
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,850
Minato...

24
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:05,270
I will come back.

25
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:11,910
But only if I get to act
with the real you.

26
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,410
Minato, don't go!
